This repository and its contents (the "Materials") are the confidential and
proprietary property of ClearPoint Strategy, LLC ("ClearPoint"). The Materials
define OKF-CPS, the ClearPoint Strategy profile of the Open Knowledge Format,
together with its schemas and tooling.

The public/private boundary of this repository is not yet settled: some parts
(the profile specification and its conventions) are candidates for release as an
open format, while others (the emitter, the diff→apply compiler, marking
enforcement, and the MCP) are intended to remain proprietary. Until that split
is formally decided and recorded, treat the entire repository as proprietary and
confidential.

